        "TileImage": "$($repository 405a95c6-c3fe-4bdb-854c-b87ed116a585).Image",
        "Description": "These security guards have been seen scrolling reels on the job,\reliminate them, as our client couldve been eliminated in that time.\r\rThe chef has put too much salt into the food he&apos;s been serving,\rnow its time that you put some stuff into his food.\r\rThe rest of the staff did not refill the mini-fridge in time and our client had to be thirsty for 5 minutes longer than expected.\r\rThese targets are highly dangerous and need to be taken care of immidietly!\rGood luck Agent 47.",
